[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2988421145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106933#issuecomment-2988421145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106933","id":2988421145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yH7AZ","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T15:00:21Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T15:00:21Z","body":"Can confirm for godot 4.5 beta1\nCan confirm for godot 4.4.1, not a regression\n\nNixOS 25.11, x86_64","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2988421145/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3134371391","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106933#issuecomment-3134371391","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106933","id":3134371391,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc660rY_","user":{"login":"ketexon","id":29184562,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTg0NTYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29184562?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon","html_url":"https://github.com/ketexon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T23:26:00Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T23:26:00Z","body":"This issue applies to all scene instances with any script overrides (including on children) in the tree (inherited scenes and editable children). The parent scene will first instantiate the `PackedScene`, which calls `_init`, and _then_ modify change the script, calling `_init` on the new script. \n\nI think this is more of an implementation detail than a bug. This is (very briefly) documented in the [GDScript reference](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#initialization-order), saying exported variables are set after `_init`, though it could be made more clear to apply to the script tag as well.\n\nThis would also be a good addition to the not yet created [inherited scenes and editable children documentation](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/5529).\n\nI do think this is a very worthwhile enhancement, since, with the current implementation, `_init` should not use any exported properties to prevent inconsistent state (yet the docs sometimes show it being used with exported properties). I imagine there could be a better way to instantiate packed scenes by providing \"override information\" to `SceneState::instantiate`. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3134371391/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3711423782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106933#issuecomment-3711423782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106933","id":3711423782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dN9Um","user":{"login":"pattlebass","id":49322676,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MzIyNjc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49322676?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass","html_url":"https://github.com/pattlebass","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pattlebass/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-05T17:37:34Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T17:37:34Z","body":"A side-effect of this is that methods called at the top level are also called twice and _can_ leak memory:\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name Base extends Node2D\n\nvar timer := Timer.new() # Will be called twice\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tadd_child(timer) # But only the second one will be added to the tree\n```\n\nFix:\n```gdscript\n@onready var timer := Timer.new()\n```\n\n\nI was having problems with seemingly random orphan nodes and it turned out to be happening only to inherited scenes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3711423782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]